    "A replay draws every player's cursor, their clicks and their selection in their colour, whatever Sight shows; the switches beside chat hide each. The stats window charts each player, or each team, over the whole game.",
    "Here each player's camera is a recorded one, so the camera moves only by Jump and Follow."
